---
import ProseLayout from '../layouts/ProseLayout.astro';
---

<ProseLayout
  title="Delete your Casebound account or data — Casebound"
  description="How to delete your Casebound account, how to delete individual data without closing your account, and exactly what is removed."
  canonicalUrl="https://casebound.co/delete-account"
>
  <h1 class="font-serif font-medium text-3xl sm:text-4xl mb-2">Delete your account or data</h1>
  <p class="text-casebound-muted text-sm mb-8"><em>Last updated: August 16, 2026.</em></p>

  <p class="mb-6">
    This page explains how to delete your <strong>Casebound</strong> account, how to delete individual data without closing your account, and exactly what is removed. Casebound is published by Pixel Master Technologies LLC.
  </p>

  <h2 class="font-serif font-medium text-xl sm:text-2xl mt-10 mb-4">Delete your entire account</h2>

  <h3 class="font-serif font-medium text-lg mt-8 mb-3">In the app &mdash; takes about 30 seconds</h3>

  <ol class="list-decimal pl-6 space-y-2 mb-4">
    <li>Open <strong>Casebound</strong> on your phone.</li>
    <li>Tap the <strong>Settings</strong> tab, at the far right of the bottom tab bar.</li>
    <li>Scroll to the bottom and tap <strong>Delete account</strong>. It is also available under Settings &rarr; Account &rarr; Delete account.</li>
    <li>Confirm when prompted.</li>
  </ol>

  <p class="mb-6">
    Deletion is immediate and permanent. There is no separate confirmation email and no recovery window &mdash; once you confirm, the account is gone.
  </p>

  <h3 class="font-serif font-medium text-lg mt-8 mb-3">By email &mdash; if you can no longer sign in</h3>

  <p class="mb-6">
    Email <a href="mailto:support@pixel-master.com?subject=Account%20deletion%20request" class="text-casebound-green underline underline-offset-4">support@pixel-master.com</a> from the address on your Casebound account, with the subject <strong>Account deletion request</strong>. We verify the request against the email on the account and complete it within 30 days, usually much sooner. If we cannot verify that you own the account, we will not delete it.
  </p>

  <h2 class="font-serif font-medium text-xl sm:text-2xl mt-10 mb-4">Delete some of your data without closing your account</h2>

  <p class="mb-4">
    You do not have to delete your account to remove individual data. Everything below can be deleted from inside the app at any time:
  </p>

  <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 mb-6">
    <li><strong>Books</strong> &mdash; open the book, then Remove from library. This also deletes its format records and progress.</li>
    <li><strong>Reading sessions</strong> &mdash; open the session from Stats or the reading calendar and delete it.</li>
    <li><strong>Reviews</strong> &mdash; open your review and delete it.</li>
    <li><strong>Book club posts and comments</strong> &mdash; use the overflow menu on your own post or comment.</li>
    <li><strong>Activity feed posts and comments</strong> &mdash; use the overflow menu on your own item.</li>
    <li><strong>Photos</strong> &mdash; delete spine photos, post photos and club cover images from the screen they were uploaded to. To replace or clear your profile photo, edit your profile from Settings &rarr; Account.</li>
    <li><strong>Custom lists and wishlist items</strong> &mdash; delete them from the Lists screen.</li>
    <li><strong>Profile details</strong> &mdash; clear your bio or display name under Settings &rarr; Account.</li>
    <li><strong>Analytics</strong> &mdash; turn off "Share anonymous analytics" under Settings &rarr; Privacy &amp; data. It is off unless you turn it on.</li>
  </ul>

  <p class="mb-6">
    If you want something removed that you cannot delete yourself, email <a href="mailto:support@pixel-master.com?subject=Data%20deletion%20request" class="text-casebound-green underline underline-offset-4">support@pixel-master.com</a> with the subject <strong>Data deletion request</strong> and tell us what to remove.
  </p>

  <h2 class="font-serif font-medium text-xl sm:text-2xl mt-10 mb-4">What gets deleted</h2>

  <p class="mb-4">Deleting your account permanently removes:</p>

  <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 mb-6">
    <li>Your account, email address and login credentials</li>
    <li>Your profile, username, display name, bio and avatar</li>
    <li>Your library, formats, ownership and reading status</li>
    <li>Reading sessions, stats, streaks and goals</li>
    <li>Custom lists and wishlist</li>
    <li>Reviews, ratings and notes</li>
    <li>Book club posts, comments and memberships</li>
    <li>Activity feed posts and comments</li>
    <li>Follows, followers and blocks</li>
    <li>Friend recommendations you sent or received</li>
    <li>Uploaded photos, including spine photos and post photos</li>
    <li>Lending records</li>
    <li>Your push notification token</li>
  </ul>

  <p class="mb-6">
    If you signed in with Apple, deletion also revokes Casebound's Sign in with Apple token, so the app no longer appears in your Apple ID's list of connected apps.
  </p>

  <h2 class="font-serif font-medium text-xl sm:text-2xl mt-10 mb-4">What is kept, and for how long</h2>

  <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 mb-6">
    <li><strong>Shared book catalogue entries.</strong> Book titles, authors, page counts and covers are shared across all Casebound users and are not personal to you. Corrections you made stay in the catalogue and are not attributed to you publicly.</li>
    <li><strong>Crash reports and product analytics.</strong> Retained in aggregated or de-identified form. Crash reports age out within 90 days; analytics within 12 months.</li>
    <li><strong>Subscription and purchase records.</strong> Retained where required for tax, accounting and dispute resolution.</li>
    <li><strong>Encrypted backups.</strong> Deleted records may persist in routine backups for up to <strong>30 days</strong> before those backups age out.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 class="font-serif font-medium text-xl sm:text-2xl mt-10 mb-4">Your subscription</h2>

  <p class="mb-4">
    Deleting your Casebound account does <strong>not</strong> cancel a Casebound Pro subscription. Subscriptions are billed by Apple or Google, not by us, and we cannot cancel one on your behalf.
  </p>

  <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 mb-4">
    <li><strong>iPhone or iPad:</strong> Settings &rarr; your name &rarr; Subscriptions &rarr; Casebound &rarr; Cancel Subscription</li>
    <li><strong>Android:</strong> Google Play &rarr; your profile icon &rarr; Payments &amp; subscriptions &rarr; Subscriptions &rarr; Casebound &rarr; Cancel</li>
  </ul>

  <p class="mb-6">
    Cancel before you delete your account, or you will continue to be billed.
  </p>

  <h2 class="font-serif font-medium text-xl sm:text-2xl mt-10 mb-4">Export your data first</h2>

  <p class="mb-6">
    Deletion is permanent. If you want a copy of your library and reading history, export it before you delete: <strong>Settings &rarr; Export library</strong>, or <strong>Settings &rarr; Privacy &amp; data &rarr; Export my data</strong>.
  </p>

  <h2 class="font-serif font-medium text-xl sm:text-2xl mt-10 mb-4">Questions</h2>

  <p class="mb-6">
    Pixel Master Technologies LLC<br />
    <a href="mailto:support@pixel-master.com" class="text-casebound-green underline underline-offset-4">support@pixel-master.com</a>
  </p>
</ProseLayout>
